{"unit_id":"58fly__dsh-stack#feature-1","repo":"58fly/dsh-stack","commit":"b5e251c13942edf93272c6c24c9573e2a4a59fd8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stack 的功能「修改后验证提醒」：agent 在一轮结束前若成功修改了文件，却没有之后成功运行检查，会收到提示并继续处理。只修改文档文件时不会触发这条提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/st-loop.mjs:144-175","preset/st-loop.mjs:249-287"]}
